# cavekit-find-on-page.md R4 (T-678): a word that is not on the page is said at once ("No matches", the field marked),
# and Next and Prev ask nothing then.
id: find-none
section: Find on page
item: Find on Page with a word not on the page (jihad-find.html, "qqxz"): the bar says No matches at once, its field marked and Next and Prev dimmed (the shot)
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-find.html
kit: cavekit-find-on-page.md R4
calibrate top
sample before-menu 0,30,300,180
chrome appmenu
wait differs 0,30,300,180 before-menu 5
wait still 0,30,300,180 3
mark
chrome appmenu-find
expect keyboard up 8
type-keys qqxz
wait line 'find .4 bytes. -> 0' 10
wait line 'find-result: {"index":0,"total":0' 10
shoot no-matches
mark
chrome find-done
wait line 'find: cleared' 8
